{"resourceIdentifier":"3959","resourceName":"Jiangsu Qidong Yongyin Recycled PET Project","description":"Jiangsu Qidong Yongyin Recycled PET Project (hereinafter called 'the Project' aims to produce the PET chips by reprocessing the waste PET products (like consumed package and bottled drink, used cable, etc.) and to replace the same PET product produced from the raw materials. The total production capacity is about 50,000 tons of recycled polyester (PET) chips per year, and the project factory will recycle 62,500 tons waste plastic PET per year. The Project located in No.1099, West Nanyuan Rd, Qidong Economic Development zone, Nantong city, Jiangsu province, China.\r\nPrior to the project implementation, the same amount of PET chips would be produced from raw materials (crude oil and natural gas) which is also the baseline scenario of the project. Therefore, the GHG emission reduction will be generated through the implementation of the project by avoiding the consumption of the equivalent raw materials and reducing related energy consumption as well.","location":{"latitude":31.816026,"longitude":121.618552},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-12-08","endExclusive":"2023-01-08","endInclusive":"2023-01-07"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3959"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jiangsu"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jiangsu Yongyin Chemical Fibre Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Jiangsu province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"3542346576@qq.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"55207"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"st